From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Altera BMC <openbmc@altera.com>
Date: Sat, 13 Jun 2026 18:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] meson: build swampd only, drop libipmid/manualcmds provider

This is a hostless BMC (the HPS is the BMC itself, no host CPU). There is
no host IPMI, so phosphor-ipmi-host is stubbed out (no libipmid in the
sysroot or on the rootfs). Stock phosphor-pid-control unconditionally
requires libipmid and builds the libmanualcmds IPMI OEM provider, which
breaks do_configure here (meson cannot find libipmid and falls back to a
disabled wrap download).

swampd's own sources do not use any ipmid symbols; only the libmanualcmds
IPMI provider does. Drop the libipmid dependency and the libmanualcmds
target so swampd/setsensor build standalone. PID fan control runs purely
from the JSON config + D-Bus sensors; the IPMI manual-control path is not
applicable on a hostless platform.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [hostless-platform specific configuration]
Signed-off-by: Altera BMC <openbmc@altera.com>
---
 meson.build | 19 -------------------
 1 file changed, 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 0a99d2e1..8a021a9d 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -88,7 +88,6 @@ phosphor_dbus_interfaces_dep = dependency('phosphor-dbus-interfaces')
 phosphor_logging_dep = dependency('phosphor-logging')
 sdbusplus_dep = dependency('sdbusplus')
 libsystemd_dep = dependency('libsystemd')
-ipmid_dep = dependency('libipmid')
 
 
 if cxx.has_header('CLI/CLI.hpp')
@@ -99,7 +98,6 @@ endif
 
 deps = [
     CLI11_dep,
-    ipmid_dep,
     libsystemd_dep,
     nlohmann_json_dep,
     phosphor_dbus_interfaces_dep,
@@ -159,23 +157,6 @@ libswampd_sources = [
     'buildjson/buildjson.cpp',
 ]
 
-libmanualcmds_sources = [
-    'ipmi/main_ipmi.cpp',
-    'ipmi/manualcmds.cpp',
-    'ipmi/dbus_mode.cpp',
-]
-
-libmanualcmds = library(
-    'manualcmds',
-    libmanualcmds_sources,
-    implicit_include_directories: false,
-    dependencies: deps,
-    version: meson.project_version(),
-    override_options: ['b_lundef=false'],
-    install: true,
-    install_dir: get_option('libdir') / 'ipmid-providers',
-)
-
 executable(
     'swampd',
     libswampd_sources,
-- 
